# Run artefacts, not source. NOTE data/trials.jsonl is the multiple-testing
# ledger: it is local because it is machine-specific, but deleting it RESETS the
# trial count and re-inflates every Deflated Sharpe. Archive it, do not clear it.
data/trials.jsonl
data/autonomy.json

# Everything under data/ is GENERATED — caches, run artefacts and fetched bars.
# Nothing in it has ever been tracked, and the OHLC + minute stores alone are
# ~29MB of regenerable market data that would bloat every clone. Refetch with
# `python -m app.data.ohlc --universe` and `python -m app.data.minute --fetch`.
# The specific rules above are kept for the notes they carry (see trials.jsonl).
data/
